IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `fica-donations-and-interference`

-- Foreign Interference (Countermeasures) Act 2021, ss 4, 14, 17-19, 45, 53, 55-58, 60, 70, 72, 75(5), 79, 86(2) -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_foreign-interference-countermeasures-act-2021.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`a 30-year-old citizen` MEANS Donor WITH
    `is an individual` IS TRUE
    `is a citizen` IS TRUE
    `age` IS 30
    `is Singapore-controlled` IS FALSE
    `carries on business wholly or mainly in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `is barred from political donating by law or its constitution` IS FALSE

