#ASSERT NOT `the recipient must refuse the donation` `a designated person with no directive` `a 45-year-old permanent resident` FALSE
#ASSERT `the recipient must refuse the donation` `a designated person with a prohibited donor directive` `a 30-year-old citizen` TRUE

